  9cc7a91d62848a33 t("Owner: the badge changes colour or vanishes on dark; the versions panel vanishes or jumps on click; Update reloads, shows again, then goes; a version warning flashes after navigation and is gone when opened. Causes (prod 25 Nov): avatar styled by the Home avatar rule (transparent, dark letter, amber disc when toned); the block remounts on every versions read, closing the panel; Update clears its busy state before the reload lands; warnings come from one momentary read (tab \"unknown\" for 3 s on every load, gateway probe older than a minute, one failed read). Rules below: the avatar is fixed; the version mark is toned only by a confirmed current problem; Update is one predictable action; nothing remounts or jumps (OR-6). Approved by the owner 25 Nov: option B and the rules below.",Inter:$font.family,12:$font.size.sm,r,align(l),lh(auto,1.25)) p(32,91) s(1180,hug:60) f[(e6eac5ab5519b815,tok(fleet.fg-muted,#9A9A9F))] "Text 2"
